 206:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_client.c ****  *  } NamedCurveList;
 207:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_client.c ****  *
 208:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_client.c ****  * The TLS 1.3 supported groups extension was defined to be a compatible
 209:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_client.c ****  * generalization of the TLS 1.2 supported elliptic curves extension. They both
 210:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_client.c ****  * share the same extension identifier.
