 848:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_client.c ****         /*
 849:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_client.c ****          * Create a legacy session identifier for the purpose of middlebox
