  46:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/alignment.h **** /* IAR recommend this technique for accessing unaligned data in
  47:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/alignment.h ****  * https://www.iar.com/knowledge/support/technical-notes/compiler/accessing-unaligned-data
  48:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/alignment.h ****  * This results in a single load / store instruction (if unaligned access is supported).
  49:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/alignment.h ****  * According to that document, this is only supported on certain architectures.
