  57:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/alignment.h **** /*
  58:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/alignment.h ****  * gcc may generate a branch to memcpy for calls like `memcpy(dest, src, 4)` rather than
  59:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/alignment.h ****  * generating some LDR or LDRB instructions (similar for stores).
