 666:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****     /** Minimum TLS version to be negotiated.
 667:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****      *
 668:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****      * It is set up in the ClientHello writing preparation stage and used
 669:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****      * throughout the ClientHello writing. Not relevant anymore as soon as
 670:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****      * the protocol version has been negotiated thus as soon as the
 671:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****      * ServerHello is received.
 672:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****      * For a fresh handshake not linked to any previous handshake, it is
