1038:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h **** /*
1039:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * Representation of decryption/encryption transformations on records
1040:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *
1041:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * There are the following general types of record transformations:
1042:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - Stream transformations (TLS versions == 1.2 only)
1043:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   Transformation adding a MAC and applying a stream-cipher
1044:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   to the authenticated message.
1045:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - CBC block cipher transformations ([D]TLS versions == 1.2 only)
1046:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   For TLS 1.2, no IV is generated at key extraction time, but every
1047:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   encrypted record is explicitly prefixed by the IV with which it was
1048:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   encrypted.
1049:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - AEAD transformations ([D]TLS versions == 1.2 only)
1050:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   These come in two fundamentally different versions, the first one
1051:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   used in TLS 1.2, excluding ChaChaPoly ciphersuites, and the second
1052:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   one used for ChaChaPoly ciphersuites in TLS 1.2 as well as for TLS 1.3.
1053:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   In the first transformation, the IV to be used for a record is obtained
1054:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   as the concatenation of an explicit, static 4-byte IV and the 8-byte
1055:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   record sequence number, and explicitly prepending this sequence number
1056:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   to the encrypted record. In contrast, in the second transformation
1057:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   the IV is obtained by XOR'ing a static IV obtained at key extraction
GAS LISTING /tmp/ccAjNtFj.s 			page 75


1058:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   time with the 8-byte record sequence number, without prepending the
1059:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   latter to the encrypted record.
1060:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *
1061:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * Additionally, DTLS 1.2 + CID as well as TLS 1.3 use an inner plaintext
1062:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * which allows to add flexible length padding and to hide a record's true
1063:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * content type.
1064:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *
1065:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * In addition to type and version, the following parameters are relevant:
1066:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - The symmetric cipher algorithm to be used.
1067:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - The (static) encryption/decryption keys for the cipher.
1068:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - For stream/CBC, the type of message digest to be used.
1069:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - For stream/CBC, (static) encryption/decryption keys for the digest.
1070:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - For AEAD transformations, the size (potentially 0) of an explicit,
1071:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   random initialization vector placed in encrypted records.
1072:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - For some transformations (currently AEAD) an implicit IV. It is static
1073:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   and (if present) is combined with the explicit IV in a transformation-
1074:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   -dependent way (e.g. appending in TLS 1.2 and XOR'ing in TLS 1.3).
1075:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - For stream/CBC, a flag determining the order of encryption and MAC.
1076:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - The details of the transformation depend on the SSL/TLS version.
1077:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - The length of the authentication tag.
1078:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *
1079:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * The struct below refines this abstract view as follows:
1080:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - The cipher underlying the transformation is managed in
1081:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   cipher contexts cipher_ctx_{enc/dec}, which must have the
1082:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   same cipher type. The mode of these cipher contexts determines
1083:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   the type of the transformation in the sense above: e.g., if
1084:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   the type is MBEDTLS_CIPHER_AES_256_CBC resp. MBEDTLS_CIPHER_AES_192_GCM
1085:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   then the transformation has type CBC resp. AEAD.
1086:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - The cipher keys are never stored explicitly but
1087:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   are maintained within cipher_ctx_{enc/dec}.
1088:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - For stream/CBC transformations, the message digest contexts
1089:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   used for the MAC's are stored in md_ctx_{enc/dec}. These contexts
1090:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   are unused for AEAD transformations.
1091:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - For stream/CBC transformations, the MAC keys are not stored explicitly
1092:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   but maintained within md_ctx_{enc/dec}.
1093:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - The mac_enc and mac_dec fields are unused for EAD transformations.
1094:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - For transformations using an implicit IV maintained within
1095:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   the transformation context, its contents are stored within
1096:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   iv_{enc/dec}.
1097:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - The value of ivlen indicates the length of the IV.
1098:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   This is redundant in case of stream/CBC transformations
1099:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   which always use 0 resp. the cipher's block length as the
1100:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   IV length, but is needed for AEAD ciphers and may be
1101:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   different from the underlying cipher's block length
1102:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   in this case.
1103:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - The field fixed_ivlen is nonzero for AEAD transformations only
1104:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   and indicates the length of the static part of the IV which is
1105:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   constant throughout the communication, and which is stored in
1106:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   the first fixed_ivlen bytes of the iv_{enc/dec} arrays.
1107:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - tls_version denotes the 2-byte TLS version
1108:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - For stream/CBC transformations, maclen denotes the length of the
1109:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   authentication tag, while taglen is unused and 0.
1110:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - For AEAD transformations, taglen denotes the length of the
1111:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   authentication tag, while maclen is unused and 0.
1112:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  * - For CBC transformations, encrypt_then_mac determines the
1113:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   order of encryption and authentication. This field is unused
1114:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/ssl_misc.h ****  *   in other transformations.
GAS LISTING /tmp/ccAjNtFj.s 			page 76


